## Testing

{% if include_tests %}
This project uses [Catch2](https://github.com/catchorg/Catch2) for testing.

### Running Tests

Build and run tests:
```bash
cmake --build build --target test
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

Or run the test executable directly:
```bash
./build/tests
```

### Test Structure

- Test files are located in the `tests/` directory
- The main test executable is `tests/test_main.cpp`
- Tests use Catch2's BDD-style macros for readable test cases

{% else %}
Testing is not enabled for this project. To enable testing, regenerate the project with `include_tests=true`.
{% endif %}